  </section>

  {/* The three linked posts (checked live against Sanity's production
      dataset during this port) already exist there, so all three link
      internally rather than to the old absolute reddoorrents.com URLs. */}
  <section class="section-soft" id="landlord-library">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head center reveal">
        <div class="section-kicker">Local Data. Practical Guidance.</div>
        <h2>The Indianapolis Landlord Library</h2>
        <p>Market updates, investment insights, and practical property-management guidance for Indianapolis rental owners.</p>
      </div>
